wn — Max Potion's ₽2,500 buys nothing, and skipping it is what made ₽36,000 buy THIRTY heals instead of fourteen. Also skipped: **Ultra Ball** (every ball is BLOCKED in trainer battles, `battle_script_commands.c:9915`) and **Max Repel** (no wild-encounter table exists for any map past the front door). ‼ **TACTICAL NOTE FOR §Ch24, MEASURED:** the AI uses a Full Restore only when the active mon is **STRICTLY BELOW 25% max HP** (`battle_ai_switch_items.c`), and its 2nd item unlocks only at ≤2 mons left — so **killing from above 25% denies the heal entirely**, and Wallace (4 Full Restores, 2nd unlocking one mon down) should be budgeted at 3-4 uses.
